{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Don't Charge Me Bro 是一款追蹤免費試用與訂閱服務的提醒工具，適合經常忘記取消試用、白白被自動續訂扣款的人。你只需輸入名稱、金額與扣款日期，App 便會為每個續期日倒數。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>扣款前層層提醒</h2>\n<p>試用與月費會在三天前、一天前、當日早上及晚上八時最後召集時發出通知，年費計劃則提前兩星期開始倒數。所有提醒交由 iOS 排程，即使多週未開啟 App 亦會準時送達。每則通知都載有名稱、金額與剩餘時間，並可一按直達 App 查看截止時間及取消途徑，讓你在錢仍屬於自己的時候及時處理。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-389-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-390-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-391-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-392-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-393-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-394-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Don't Charge Me Bro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T07:39:57.196702+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}